00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:58,770
Purple Star Pavilion
Purple Division of the
Heavenly Fate Sect

25
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,850
All the powerful figures of Tian Yun

26
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:01,930
will come to celebrate Master's anniversary.

27
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:06,050
Master actually plans to publicly announce taking Wang Lin as his disciple...

28
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,850
What's so special about him !?

29
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,330
I have waited 2000 years

30
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:18,650
