31
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:21,650
How could I possibly let him take my place ?

32
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:25,130
Second Brother Zhou Wan's cultivation was damaged

33
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,850
so he's out of the equation.

34
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,450
Third Brother Bai Wei is unpredictable

35
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,730
but he was never a match for me to begin with.

36
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:35,090
Fourth Sister Zhao Xinmeng has a good cultivation

37
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,370
but I have ways to deal with her.

38
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,450
Fifth Brother Jin Ye was punished by Master

39
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:42,290
to 100 years of secluded cultivation.

40
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:45,490
Sixth Brother Chen Tao has reached Ascendant

41
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:48,490
but he disappeared after Sun Yun took his place.

42
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,810
The only variable

43
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,170
is Wang Lin !

44
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,650
I noticed earlier today that

45
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,050
Seventh Junior Brother's cultivation

46
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:19,530
was significantly lower than when we first met on the trade planet.

47
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:23,770
You didn't need artifacts and spells to fight a Middle stage Soul Transformation.

48
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,650
Can you tell me why ?

49
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,650
No comments.

50
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,650
It's fine.

51
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,650
The more secrets,

52
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,210
the more intriguing.

53
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:43,170
Might I ask the purpose of Third Senior Brother's visit ?

54
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:46,370
You haven't collected your robes, identity token, and other items

55
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:48,050
so I brought them to you.

56
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:49,730
Thank you.

57
00:03:50,990 --> 00:03:53,410
You are still unfamiliar with the Purple Division.

58
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,130
How about

59
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:56,210
letting your Senior Brother give you a tour ?

60
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,170
No need.

61
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:58,930
Seventh Junior Brother !

62
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:02,330
Don't you want to know why Senior Brother is targetting you ?

63
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,850
Or about what becoming a Son of Tian Yun

64
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,170
actually means ?

65
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,890
Every thousand years,

66
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:14,370
the sect will organize a competition to determine the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

67
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,570
Whenever a position is vacant

68
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:18,370
or someone issues a challenge,

69
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,850
it leads to a duel.

70
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,610
2000 years ago,

71
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:24,010
Zhao Xingsha joined the Purple Division.

72
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,050
He was already Late stage Soul Transformation.

73
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:28,010
but during the competition,

74
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:30,450
he was injured by Sixth Junior Brother Chen Tao.

75
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,250
His cultivation plummeted.

76
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:37,050
He could only watch helplessly as Chen Tao became a Son of Tian Yun.

77
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:39,530
But Zhao Xingsha didn't give up.

78
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:42,930
He stubbornly cultivated for a 1000 years.

79
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:45,450
But during the last competition,

80
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:48,130
another Seventh Junior Brother, Sun Yun, emerged.

81
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,690
Both Zhao Xingsha and Chen Tao were defeated.

82
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:52,890
Sun Yun

83
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,890
then became the new Son of Tian Yun.

84
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,850
The next competition

85
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,450
is in 3 months.

86
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,970
Sun Yun betrayed the sect and fled.

87
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,850
The Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun has been vacant since then.

88
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:08,250
Chen Tao also left after he lost to Sun Yun.

89
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,490
We haven't heard from him

90
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,970
in 1000 years.

91
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,050
So you are his greatest opponent

92
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:17,370
in the next sect competition.

93
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,650
Titles are merely empty fame.

94
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,450
Why do they fight for it ?

95
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,650
Empty fame ?

96
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:29,290
The Seven Sons of Tian Yun are extremely noble.

97
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,530
They can

98
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,210
choose any country on Planet Tian Yun,

99
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:35,170
or even whole planets controlled by Tian Yun

100
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,930
as their own cultivation cave.

101
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,250
Is that all ?

102
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,130
Besides that,

103
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:44,330
Master will personally assist them during the Ascendant breakthrough,

104
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:47,290
increasing the chance of success by 30%.

105
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:50,850
He even provides the Seven Sons of Tian Yun with unlimited celestial jades.

106
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,570
Aren't you tempted ?

107
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,450
If you don't want empty fame,

108
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,650
to reach Ascendant,

109
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,050
or infinite celestial jades,

110
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,530
maybe you want celestial spells ?

111
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:07,610
If a Son of Tian Yun holds the title for 3000 years

112
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:11,650
Master will give them a low-grade celestial spell.

113
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,170
Long ago,

114
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,650
Ye Wuyou had obtained

115
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:17,770
