124
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,610
Even fragments are hard to find.

125
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,930
It all depends on luck...

126
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,850
A low-grade celestial spell...

127
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,770
