128
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,650
Of course.

129
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:52,130
Why are you telling me this ?

130
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:54,290
Don't you want

131
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,090
