132
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,610
I can't become a Son of Tian Yun

133
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:03,050
and you are the only rival Zhao Xingsha has

134
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:05,050
in the next competition.

135
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,650
I just want a single thing

136
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:10,650
and that's to prevent Zhao Xingsha from winning.

137
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,930
Only then

138
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:15,370
will I get my revenge for what he did back then !

139
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:20,730
Sorry,

140
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,930
I lost my composure.

141
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,850
I won't disturb you anymore today.

142
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,810
If you need anything,

143
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:29,970
Seventh Junior Brother can come find me anytime.

144
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:39,730
Bai Wei's personal grudge with Zhao Xingsha isn't my problem

145
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:42,570
but if what he said about celestial spells is true

146
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:45,370
then it's worth trying

147
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:48,290
to become a Son of Tian Yun.

148
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:01,490
The Heavenly Fate Sect is astonishing.

149
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,450
If direct disciples can get free celestial jades,

150
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,530
Treasure Pavilion
Purple Division of the
Heavenly Fate Sect

151
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,890
