167
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,130
Is there a problem ?

168
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:55,410
This sword has a wisp of an old friend's Sword Spirit.

169
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,770
I will take it.

170
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,450
In exchange,

171
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,530
