193
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,210
Forbidden spell...

194
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,690
Teleport !

195
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:30,730
Stone Forest
Outskirts of the Heavenly Fate Sect

196
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,250
