203
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:02,530
Zhao Xingsha...

204
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,050
Come out !

205
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,810
Seventh Brother,

206
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:11,810
