209
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:24,090
I'm the Third Disciple of the Blue Division,

210
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,450
Sima Rufeng.

211
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,850
Junior Brother Wang Lin,

212
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,330
I have heard

213
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:29,930
Sima Rufeng
Heavenly Fate Sect Blue Division disciple
Late stage Soul Transformation

214
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:30,490
of your name.

215
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:33,970
