216
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:37,530
He should be Late stage Soul Transformation.

217
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,450
Although he's not yet Ascendant,

218
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:42,650
Wang Yu
Heavenly Fate Sect Green Division disciple
Late stage Soul Transformation

219
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:43,050
