221
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:49,330
I originally didn't consider you a threat.

222
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,570
But what happened yesterday,

223
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,890
I must admit

224
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,370
you

225
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:57,290
