226
00:11:57,880 --> 00:11:58,890
Senior Brother,

227
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,490
I have repaid the favor I owed you.

228
00:12:01,880 --> 00:12:03,250
From now on,

229
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:05,250
