230
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,290
Everyone,

231
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:25,850
make your move !

232
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:39,170
How do you like the formation

233
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,130
