234
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,850
Seventh Brother,

235
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,850
don't waste your efforts on the formation.

236
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:47,690
Once Master's birthday is over

237
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:50,370
