239
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:57,850
If I can't break this formation at Early stage Soul Transformation,

240
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,650
then I might be able to at Middle stage.

241
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:05,370
As long as I can reach Middle stage Soul Transformation within 3 months,

242
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:08,050
