245
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:27,490
3 months later

246
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:30,930
Main Palace
of the Heavenly Fate Sect

247
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,250
Fellow cultivator !

248
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:37,250
