249
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,570
Long time no see !

250
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:39,930
Brother Zhao,

251
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:40,690
I hope you're well.

252
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,650
I hope you're well.

253
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:44,650
Please, take a seat.

254
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,930
Once the banquet begins,

255
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:47,450
