256
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,450
Of course, of course.

257
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:49,410
Look !

258
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,770
Such a majestic chariot !

259
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,090
Yes !

260
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:54,130
