261
00:13:53,520 --> 00:13:57,010
Chi Lie
All-Seer's Junior Brother
Nirvana Scryer

262
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,650
I must stand out

263
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,170
on Master's birthday.

264
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,970
All the powerful cultivators must know my name.

265
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,890
Once I become a Son of Tian Yun,

266
00:14:04,920 --> 00:14:07,730
