267
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,490
Paying respects to Master !

268
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:40,850
Paying respects to Senior All-Seer !

269
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:46,330
All-Seer,

270
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,330
