273
00:14:54,840 --> 00:14:57,810
The fact that you have all come from afar

274
00:14:57,880 --> 00:15:00,330
is the best gift of all.

275
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,850
There are banquets in each of the 7 divisions.

276
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:05,890
Everyone,

277
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,810
please have a seat.

278
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:02,650
Wang Lin's avatar
Middle stage Soul Transformation

279
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,490
Situ Nan told me

280
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,530
that with a higher cultivation,

281
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:09,530
the three killing spells will get stronger.

282
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,290
Let me see

283
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,850
how much this formation can withstand.

284
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,490
Death Finger !

285
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,730
Demonic Finger !

286
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:43,020
So it's not that strong...

287
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,370
Cao Yidou,

288
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,130
do you know the way

289
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,050
to the Heavenly Fate Sect ?

290
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:58,970
Yes.

291
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,650
We're celebrating Master's birthday today.

292
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:12,010
And tomorrow, Master will give a lecture on the Dao.

293
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,130
If our Purple Division

294
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:16,650
has been lacking in hospitality these past few days

295
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,130
I hope you will be excuse us.

296
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:24,170
I've heard that after the lecture,

297
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:27,210
there will be a competition for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

298
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,450
I think that

299
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,970
Brother Zhao has a high chance of winning.

300
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,370
You flatter me.

301
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,530
What's that ?

302
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,730
Is someone coming ?

303
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:40,170
Such a large commotion...

304
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,450
Are they hostile ?

305
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:43,370
Who dares to intrude in our Heavenly Fate Sect ?

306
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,370
How is this possible ?

307
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:51,130
It's just been 3 months.

308
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,530
Not only did he break free

309
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,370
but he also reached Middle stage Soul Transformation ?

310
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:58,130
Seventh Brother,

311
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,770
it's quite disrespectful of you to be late

312
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,970
at an important event

313
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,890
like this banquet.

314
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:06,310
He's the Seventh disciple of the Purple Division ?

315
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,250
Why is he late for Master's banquet ?

316
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,410
So disrespectful...

317
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:12,050
Senior Brother,

318
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,930
all you've done is messing with me

319
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,930
since I joined the Heavenly Fate Sect.

320
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:18,450
You've even gone to the extent

321
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:22,010
of seeking outside help to prevent me from coming today

322
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:24,050
by teleporting me away from the sect

323
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,450
and trapping me in the Stone Forest.

324
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:28,050
I, Wang Lin, have a principle.

325
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,970
If one doesn't mess with me,

326
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,570
I won't mess with them.

327
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:34,650
But if someone dares to mess with me

328
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:37,050
I will destroy them !

329
00:18:44,440 --> 00:20:49,210
It wasn't properly explained how the All-Seer's disciples work.
The All-Seer has 7 true direct disciples known as the Seven Sons of Tian Yun (they actually weren't ever called like that in the novel but just called "true disciples").
But there is a total of 49 disciples of the All-Seer that lead each of the 7 divisions (that's what Wang Lin is right now). Below those are regular Heavenly Fate Sect disciples.
It's said that the Seven Sons of Tian Yun get infinite celestial jades and then it isn't really explained why Wang Lin fetches celestial jades. That's because there is a regular distribution of celestial jades to the All-Seer's disciples. Each one gets 100 celestial jades per month. But the jades are assigned by slot and the slot of the Seventh Purple Division disciple has been empty since Sun Yun left 103 years ago.
That astronomical number of celestial jades blows Wang Lin's mind. In the donghua he just like "Yeah cool I can cultivate now".


Wang Lin was startled. Even with his mental strength, he couldn’t help but be shocked. He took a deep breath and said, “I want to withdraw them all !”

“A total of 123,600 pieces !” As the giant’s voice echoed, countless celestial jades flew out of the giant’s body and piled up before Wang Lin.

Wang Lin stared at the the pile of celestial jades as it rapidly grew and felt his throat dry up. He never would have thought that the Heavenly Fate Sect distributed celestial jades like this.
“If a disciple spot remains empty for tens of thousands of years, then won’t the amount of celestial jades collect to an unimaginable degree ? Celestial jades are supposed to be rare, so why does the Heavenly Sect have so many…” Wang Lin took a deep breath. At this moment, the celestial jades had already formed a small mountain. His eyes lit up as he quickly put them into his bag of holding.

After doing all of this, he touched his bag of holding. He still felt like none of this was real.

330
00:18:49,990 --> 00:18:55,880
I've been walking this path for endless years

331
00:18:52,290 --> 00:18:55,880
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

332
00:18:56,270 --> 00:19:01,480
Is it the compass of fate

333
00:18:58,110 --> 00:19:01,480
that wrote this outcome for us ?

334
00:19:01,390 --> 00:19:07,400
The heavens want to erase your existence,

335
00:19:07,270 --> 00:19:13,120
that's the obsession guiding me.

336
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:18,720
Is this the path to uncover

337
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:18,720
truths from falsehoods ?

338
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:24,320
In a world of murk and shadow,

339
00:19:20,650 --> 00:19:24,320
only the flame of truth can light the way.

340
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:30,040
Look at them all,

341
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:30,040
being carried by the waves.

342
00:19:30,230 --> 00:19:34,680
Look at them all,

343
00:19:32,390 --> 00:19:34,680
being drowned.

344
00:19:34,510 --> 00:19:38,000
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

345
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:41,080
I will let the world refine my soul.

346
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:46,640
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

347
00:19:42,650 --> 00:19:46,640
I will fight.

348
00:19:46,390 --> 00:19:49,760
I'll break through the abyss of despair

349
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:52,800
to finally learn who I really am.

350
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:58,160
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

351
00:19:54,430 --> 00:19:58,160
I embrace this obsession.

352
00:19:57,910 --> 00:20:01,120
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

353
00:20:00,870 --> 00:20:03,920
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

354
00:20:03,670 --> 00:20:09,400
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

355
00:20:05,710 --> 00:20:09,400
I'll still fight.

356
00:20:09,350 --> 00:20:12,760
It's hard to avoid loneliness

357
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:15,800
when you are above everyone else.

358
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:21,480
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

359
00:20:17,870 --> 00:20:21,480
be afraid of a firefly ?
